The species reference the app serves is derived from public data whose
licences are carried through to every page and every record:

  GBIF Backbone Taxonomy and occurrence data     CC BY 4.0 / CC0 per record
  World Checklist of Vascular Plants, RBG Kew     CC BY 4.0
  CHELSA V2.1 climatologies                       CC0 1.0
  NASA POWER                                      public domain (US Government)
  iNaturalist photographs                         CC0, CC BY, CC BY-SA per photo
  Wikimedia Commons photographs                   CC0, CC BY, CC BY-SA per file
  Wikipedia summaries                             CC BY-SA 4.0
  OpenAlex                                        CC0 1.0
  Natural Earth coastlines                        public domain

No other data is used. Nothing on a species page is written by a person or
a language model; see /about/how in the running app.
